  "description": "The Brighton 7 is Brooklyn Bicycle Co.'s cruiser bike, built around a relaxed geometry that lets you place both feet flat on the ground while seated. That low center of gravity and relaxed riding position make the Brighton one of the most comfortable bikes you can ride, whether you are pedaling along the boardwalk or cruising to a neighborhood cafe. A 7-speed Shimano drivetrain provides enough range for gentle hills and headwinds without overcomplicating the ride. The 26-inch wheels accelerate quickly and maneuver easily through tight spaces. A wide, cushioned saddle and swept-back handlebars keep you comfortable on leisurely rides. Fender mounts let you add coverage for wet roads, and a rear rack mount handles baskets or bags. The Brighton is the bike for riders who value comfort and style above all else.",
